	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17922"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262" title="View the profile of Mendolok">Mendolok</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 46<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/matrix.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I was going to beat TIME . . . but I got High.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=262"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17922#msg17922"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17922#msg17922">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 11:20:16 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Coming from a defector and turn coat, that wouldnt surprise me.&nbsp; Mercenaries only loyalties are usually begin and end with, &quot;Whats in it for me?&quot;.<br /><br />Speaking from a personal perspective as an officer, guild leader, and member of multiple guilds in my time, anytime you have one member and his multiple computers causing your officers to not want to log on, thats not something you want &quot;to buy someone a beer for&quot;.<br /><br />Maybe some more guild jumping merc peeps could come in and say &quot;Soulmate is soooooooooooo awesome&quot;&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />You WOULD think after 5 years, 50 guilds, 4 or 5 accounts, that the poor poor wizard would have a ton of friends coming to his aid against a terrible aweful flamer like myself.&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br /><br />Then again, who cares, he came with his &quot;goodbye post&quot; and I am answering with a goodbye of my own to someone who personally made my EQ experience, worse, when he was online.&nbsp; And not just on one or two occasions, his attitude, his self centeredness, his bs, his needs, his loyalty to friends or guild mates, and his comments SUCKED.&nbsp; He&#039;s a dick.&nbsp; That may work in the military, but not in EQ.&nbsp; Later dick.<br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Mendolok<br />Chanter of Chanters<br />1000 faces for 1000 Camps
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17923"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 114<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17923#msg17923"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17923#msg17923">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 11:38:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17922#msg17922">Quote from: Mendolok on September 21, 2005, 11:20:16 am</a></div><div class="quote">Coming from a defector and turn coat, that wouldnt surprise me.&nbsp; Mercenaries only loyalties are usually begin and end with, &quot;Whats in it for me?&quot;.<br /></div><br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Come on bro, you may call me a defector for leaving UoP, but I&#039;m sure if you were even remotely aware of my circumstances for leaving you would know it had nothing to do with selfish &quot;what&#039;s in it for me?&quot; reasons.&nbsp; My biggest mistake was agreeing to be an officer in UoP because I became instantly aware of ALL the sh*t that was going on, the drama, etc.&nbsp; I should have stayed a rank and file member, totally ignorant of any of the problems in the guild, and I&#039;d probably still be a member today.<br /><br />I&#039;m sure I had your REAL character&#039;s name figured out at one point in time, but its escaping me now.&nbsp; I&#039;m thinking Sorcery . . . tight with the Boston officer crew (you spoke of running around with 4 or 5 officer), got really pissed at one point and blasted UoP on these boards, apped to RoS, went back to UoP . . . sounds about right, but I&#039;m not 100% sure.<br /><br />In any event, continue with your diatribe against Soulmate.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17924"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472" title="View the profile of Kriyn">Kriyn</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 95<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/jonny/jonny54.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m not living, I&#039;m just killing time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=472"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" title="Magelo - Kriyn Nutzforcatnip" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17924#msg17924"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17924#msg17924">Re: Signing off ......</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> September 21, 2005, 01:32:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was in Flight of Dragons with Soulmate before he joined UoP.&nbsp; I don&#039;t know what happend in UoP when he was in there.&nbsp; I was in RoS with him and he didn&#039;t &quot;stink&quot; up the guild what so ever.&nbsp; When RoS broke up, himself and Kayela quit soon after.&nbsp; Also, him being in 50 guilds is exagerating it a bit isn&#039;t it?&nbsp; From what I remember he was maybe in like three or four different guilds since I started in 2001.&nbsp; Those being FoD, UoP, and RoS.&nbsp; I just can&#039;t see how he could make your time in EQ so bad.&nbsp; Anyway, you&#039;re entitled to your opinion just as I am.&nbsp; Leaving a guild doesn&#039;t automatically lable you as a guild jumper.&nbsp; Sometimes a guild isn&#039;t progressing the way you want, or you are just having problems that can&#039;t be resolved.&nbsp; &nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />I&#039;m ok, how are you?<br /><a href="http://www.ateaseweb.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.treefingers.com/gallery/gallery/radiohead/radiohead13.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=635213" target="_blank">Kriyn Nutzforcatnip</a><br />70 Prophet of Radiohead
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
