							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1578.msg17924#msg17924">Quote from: Kriyn on September 21, 2005, 01:32:15 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Leaving a guild doesn&#039;t automatically lable you as a guild jumper.  Sometimes a guild isn&#039;t progressing the way you want, or you are just having problems that can&#039;t be resolved.    <br /></div><br />Or it could be he just wasnt getting all the loot with his botted toons.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br /><br />
